      title: "Henry Ford's Famous Car",
      gamesTitle: "GAMELAR RO'YXATI",
      textHtml: `<h3>Henry Ford's Famous Car</h3><p>My name is Henry Ford, and I <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="ixtiro qildim">invented</span> a car called the Model T. I used to watch <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="karetalar, ot-aravalarni">carriages</span> on the streets. They fascinated me. Then I got a job as a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="kichik, tajribasiz">junior</span> <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="mexanik">mechanic</span>. My father <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="tanqid qildi">criticized</span> me. He wanted me to run the farm. But I did not <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="o'zgartirmadim">shift</span> my plans.</p><p>Then I worked for the Detroit Auto Company. But I wanted to make cars using less <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="mehnat">labor</span>. That way, there would be fewer <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="xarajatlar">expenses</span>. I started the Ford Motor Company in 1903. At first, the company did not do well. But many people were <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="tikishayotgan edi, ishongan edi">betting</span> on my success. I also had a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="samimiy, chinakam">sincere</span> <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="maqsad">aim</span> to make a car that anybody could buy.</p><p>Then, in 1908, I introduced the Model-T in a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="rasmiy">formal</span> ceremony. It <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="tasdiqladi">confirmed</span> that I was right: it was possible to build a car my way!</p><p>The Model T <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="farqlanardi">differed</span> from other vehicles. Workers could <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="ulamoq, biriktirmoq">attach</span> different parts for cars or trucks. This saved time. One Model T could be put together in 93 minutes. All of them had the same <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="klassik, odatiy">classic</span> design. They were all the same size and <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="balandlik, bo'y">height</span>. The <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="asosiy, birinchi galdagi">prime</span> reason for doing this was to save money.</p><p>Over 19 years, I sold over 15 million Model Ts. This sent a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="ishora, signal">signal</span> to other companies. People would buy cars to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="qatnash, qatnab ishlash">commute</span> to work if the price was low enough.</p>`,
      videoUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/tgbNymZ7vqY",
      keywordsList: [{ word: "aim", translation: "maqsad, intilish" }, { word: "attach", translation: "biriktirmoq, ulamoq" }, { word: "bet", translation: "garov o'ynamoq, tikmoq" }, { word: "carriage", translation: "kareta, ot-arava" }, { word: "classic", translation: "klassik, an'anaviy" }, { word: "commute", translation: "ishga qatnamoq (uzoqdan)" }, { word: "confirm", translation: "tasdiqlamoq" }, { word: "criticize", translation: "tanqid qilmoq" }, { word: "differ", translation: "farqlanmoq, ajralib turmoq" }, { word: "expense", translation: "xarajat, chiqim" }, { word: "formal", translation: "rasmiy" }, { word: "height", translation: "balandlik, bo'y" }, { word: "invent", translation: "ixtiro qilmoq" }, { word: "junior", translation: "kichik, quyi lavozimdagi" }, { word: "labor", translation: "mehnat, ish kuchi" }, { word: "mechanic", translation: "mexanik" }, { word: "prime", translation: "asosiy, eng muhim" }, { word: "shift", translation: "o'zgartirmoq, ko'chirmoq" }, { word: "signal", translation: "signal, ishora" }, { word: "sincere", translation: "samimiy, chinakam" }],
      testUrl: "https://slike7236-hash.github.io/universal-quiz-server/?lesson=ess2_17",
      games: { matchup: "...", anagrama: "...", typeanswer: "...", wordsearch: "...", pair: "..." }
